## Mailbox consumption (current focus)

**Infra port is complete** — Application adapts upstream; do not push agent/tool names into `Infrastructure/Mailbox`.

```text
EntityRefMentionContextService ─┐
EmailTriageTools.Session ───────┼→ WorkspaceReferenceService  (ref → id / MailboxAccountContext)
CreateChatThread / UpdateChatThreadAgent ─┘
EmailTriageTools ───────────────→ WorkspaceMailboxService → IMailboxService
TestEmailAccountConnection ─────→ EmailAccountMailboxService → IMailboxService
              ↑ EmailSettingsMapping (stored/draft merge in EmailAccounts slice)
```

| Layer | Role | Key files |
|-------|------|-----------|
| **References** | Single workspace dispatch — identity + per-module action resolvers | `Shared/References/Services.cs` (`WorkspaceReferenceService`, `EntityRefMentionContextService`) |
| **Gateway** | Resolved account + infra filters → port mirror → `MailboxResult<T>` | `Shared/Services.cs` (`WorkspaceMailboxService`) |
| **Email setup** | Stored/draft merge + connection probe (Path B) | `EmailAccounts/Services.cs` (`EmailAccountMailboxService`) |
| **Persistence** | `StoredMailboxSettings` — merge/draft/save; not infra `EmailSettings` | `EmailAccounts/DTOs.cs`, `Helpers.cs` (`EmailSettingsMapping`) |
| **Helpers** | Date parsing, filter builders, text formatting | `Shared/MailboxReadHelpers.cs` |
| **Tools** | Agent tool catalog + per-turn `MailboxListSnapshot` | `AI/Tools/EmailTriageTools.cs` |

**Wired today:** full port surface — list/get messages, attachments, folders, folder stats, status, send, save draft, delete, move, copy, set flags, create folder; richer list filters and send/draft params.

**Deferred to Layer 6b–6e:** compare helper, thread memory, action_list hardening.

**Conventions:** map at the port (`ToMailRuntime()` before `IMailboxService`); infra filters in agent commands (no thin duplicate request types); agent-facing names OK in Application (`GetStatusAsync` wraps `TestConnectionAsync`). See `conventions.mdc`.

