## Workspace entity references (@mentions)

Two project-wide requirements; each workspace module participates differently:

| Requirement | Role | Key files |
|-------------|------|-----------|
| **Identity** | `kind:alias` handles — parse, search, alias ↔ id | `Shared/References/Helpers.cs` (`EntityRefs`, `EntityRefMentions`), per-slice `SearchMentionItemsAsync` |
| **Action** | User-scoped runtime — ref → usable entity → work | Per-module resolver (mailbox: `MailboxAccountResolver`); callers use `WorkspaceReferenceService` in `References/Services.cs` |

**Mention pipeline:** `EntityRefMentionContextService.ResolveAsync` parses once, resolves via `WorkspaceReferenceService` — identity kinds → `TryResolveIdAsync` + repo formatting; mailbox → `TryResolveMailboxAsync`. For Email agent turns, also pre-resolves the default mailbox account once. Tools receive `DefaultMailboxAccount` and cache per alias; gateway accepts only resolved accounts.
